==Trivia==
* In [[Pokémon GO]], "Hiker" is the name of an achievement {{GO|medal}} awarded for catching at least 10 {{type|Rock}} Pokémon.
* The Hiker is voiced by Kaiji Tang in [[Pokémon Masters EX]].
* The three types Hikers tend to specialize in (Rock, Ground, and Fighting) are the same three types represented by the {{TCG|Fighting}} {{TCG|type}} in the {{PTCG}}.
* The Alolan Hiker was designed by [[Naoki Saito]].<ref name==twitter> Naoki Saito's Twitter [https://twitter.com/_NaokiSaito/status/803569255601930240]</ref>

